{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"三年春王正月，不雨。夏四月，不雨。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"徐人取舒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"六月，雨。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"秋，齊侯、宋公、江人、黃人會于陽穀。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"冬，公子友如齊涖盟。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"楚人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"三年春，不雨。夏六月，雨。自十月不雨，至于五月，不曰旱，不為災也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"秋，會于陽穀，謀伐楚也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"齊侯為陽穀之會來尋盟。冬，公子友如齊涖盟。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"楚人伐鄭，鄭伯欲成。孔叔不可，曰：「齊方勤我，棄德不祥。」","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_66_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_66","textTraditional":"齊侯與蔡姬乘舟于囿，蕩公。公懼，變色。禁之，不可。公怒，歸之，未之絕也。蔡人嫁之。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}